Package: crtrend
Title: Joinpoint Regression for Trend Analysis
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Qiong", "Chen", , "chenq08@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2401-0046"))
Description: Fit segmented joinpoint regression models to grouped time-series
    data, with separate functions for annual percent change (APC) and
    interval-specific average annual percent change (AAPC), including
    confidence intervals.
